      "side": 1,
      "message": "To get the right `extra_fonts` in your Skia checkout do `bin/sk asset download skparagraph resources/extra_fonts`. The way to figure this out is to go look in `\u003cskia\u003e/infra/bots/tasks.json` for the job name (here `Test-Debian10-Clang-GCE-CPU-AVX2-x86_64-Debug-All-NativeFonts_Fontations`) and look for `extra_fonts` which will tell you which cipd package is going where.\n\nIt looks like `TestCanvas` writes out to `skiatest::GetTmpDir()` (if it is non-empty) which is set with `--tmpDir` or `-t`.",
